  "With Confidence": "充满信心",
  "FiroGate is a modern payment gateway built for Firo.": "FiroGate 是为 Firo 打造的现代支付网关。",
  "Connect your receiving address, integrate a simple API request,": "连接您的收款地址,集成一次简单的 API 请求,",
  "and start accepting payments with fast confirmations, secure": "即可开始接收付款,享受快速确认、安全的",
  "infrastructure, and reliable transaction processing.": "基础设施与可靠的交易处理。",
  "Secure Payments": "安全支付",
  "Reliable Processing": "可靠处理",
  "Developer-Friendly": "开发者友好",
  "Three steps from integration to confirmed payment.": "从集成到付款确认,只需三步。",
  "1. Connect your wallet.": "1. 连接您的钱包。",
  "Create an account and add your Firo receiving address. Payments land directly with you we never hold the funds.": "创建账户并添加您的 Firo 收款地址。款项直接进入您的钱包 我们从不保管资金。",
  "2. Generate a payment link.": "2. 生成支付链接。",
  "One simple request creates a full checkout page. Send the link to your customer they see the amount, the address, and a live countdown.": "一次简单的请求即可创建完整的结账页面。将链接发送给客户 他们会看到金额、地址以及实时倒计时。",
  "3. Get paid automatically.": "3. 自动收款。",
  "The moment the payment is confirmed on-chain your customer is redirected to your success page and your server is notified. No manual work, no chasing.": "付款在链上确认的那一刻,客户即被跳转到成功页,您的服务器同时收到通知。无需人工操作,无需追单。",
  "What We Actually Do": "我们实际做什么",
  "We turn a single API call into a complete checkout experience for your customers, and a confirmed-payment notification for your server. That's the whole job.": "我们把一次 API 调用变成完整的客户结账体验,以及发往您服务器的付款确认通知。这就是全部工作。",
  "Every order gets its own one-time payment address, so no two customers ever share a history. The checkout works the same whether you host it on the open internet or behind a hidden service same link, same notification, same experience.": "每个订单都会获得自己一次性的付款地址,因此任何两位客户都不会共用历史记录。无论您将其托管在公网还是隐藏服务后,结账体验完全一致 同一个链接,同样的通知,同样的体验。",
  "Payments confirm on their own. Once enough confirmations are reached your plan activates, your customer gets access, and your webhook fires. You don't have to lift a finger.": "付款会自行确认。一旦达到所需确认数,您的套餐自动激活、客户获得访问权限、您的 webhook 触发。您完全不必动手。",
  "Every customer's email is captured at checkout, every payment is timestamped, and your dashboard shows the full picture nothing hidden, nothing missed.": "每位客户的邮箱在结账时被记录,每笔付款都有时间戳,您的控制台展示完整画面 不隐藏任何信息,不遗漏任何细节。",
  "How We Protect You": "我们如何保护您",
  "We use modern security practices to protect your account and your customers' data. Every sensitive action such as signing in, changing settings, and confirming payments is protected by layered controls designed to detect and prevent abuse in real time.": "我们采用现代化的安全实践来保护您的账户与客户数据。每一项敏感操作 例如登录、修改设置、确认付款 都受到多层控制保护,实时检测并防止滥用。",
  "Two-factor authentication is available for every account and strongly recommended. High-risk actions may require additional verification, ensuring that a stolen password alone is not enough to compromise an account. Suspicious activity is automatically rate-limited and monitored.": "每个账户均可启用两步验证,我们强烈建议开启。高风险操作可能需要额外验证,确保即便密码泄露也不足以攻陷账户。可疑活动会被自动限速并持续监控。",
  "Session tokens are short-lived, sensitive data is carefully handled, and all critical actions are logged with timestamps for auditability. Bot traffic is filtered at the edge, and all communication is secured with strict transport encryption.": "会话令牌时效短暂,敏感数据处理审慎,所有关键操作均带时间戳记录以便审计。机器人流量在边缘被过滤,所有通信均通过严格的传输加密保护。",
  "What we don't do:": "我们不做什么:",
  "store user private keys, rely solely on unverified client-side data, or transmit passwords, recovery codes, or sensitive credentials to any third party.": "不存储用户私钥,不仅依赖未经验证的客户端数据,也不会把密码、恢复码或敏感凭据传输给任何第三方。",
  "Who This Is For": "适合的用户",
  "Built for developers, startups, and online businesses that want to accept Firo payments without relying on custodial platforms. Whether you're launching a product, running a service, or managing digital sales, FiroGate gives you a direct and reliable way to get paid.": "为希望接收 Firo 付款且不依赖托管平台的开发者、初创团队与线上业务而打造。无论您正在发布产品、运营服务还是管理数字销售,FiroGate 都提供一种直接而可靠的收款方式。",
  "No account approvals, no fund holding, and no unnecessary friction. You stay in control while we handle payment detection, confirmation, and delivery through a simple integration.": "无账户审批、无资金托管、无多余阻力。您始终掌控,我们通过简洁的集成处理付款检测、确认与交付。",
  "Start Accepting Firo Payments": "开始接收 Firo 付款",
  "Integrate once, connect your address, and start receiving payments directly on-chain no custody, no delays.": "集成一次,连接地址,即可在链上直接接收付款 不托管,不延迟。",
